# Managerial Compensation & Performance Guidelines

*(Confidential - Restricted to Managers and HR)*

## 1. Annual Calibration Timeline
- Self & Peer Reviews: Open September 15 – October 5.
- Manager Assessment & Rating Submission: Due October 15.
- Department Calibration Sessions: October 20 – October 28.
- Merit & Equity Statements Issued: November 15.

## 2. Rating Rubric
- Level 1: Developing / Needs Coaching
- Level 2: Fully Meets Role Expectations
- Level 3: Frequently Exceeds Expectations / Force Multiplier
- Promotion packages require 2 peer endorsements, manager rationale, and director signoff.